  ],
  "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Zines</h1>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n      <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5451eab5e4b0d6969dc1ec71/959ff02e-f9df-405d-b219-ef24245f824e/IMG_9784.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\"/>\n  \n\n\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Race-ing and Dating: Issue 2</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A collection of short essays I’ve written over two to three years about my experiences of dating in KL as a black man. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n      <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5451eab5e4b0d6969dc1ec71/089d71b9-1927-4dee-8d31-e9c8db192726/IMG_3610.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\"/>\n  \n\n\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Love &amp; Lockdown</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A collaborative zine I wrote one essay for and co-edited with my friend <a href=\"https://weekendyarner.com\">Kathleen Fernandez</a> about dating during the pandemic.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n      <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5451eab5e4b0d6969dc1ec71/d12cd8a5-d2f2-4125-9bd7-5efdf759b196/IMG_3646.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\"/>\n  \n\n\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Zine Nilam</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The prompt was think of your love life in 2022 as a book. Now write a review of that book. We got so many interesting submissions for this one. It was edited by me and my friend Nadia Rosli.</p>\n</div>"
}